{"id":"perspective","lemma":"perspective","pos":"noun","rank":4334,"glosses":["perspective","prospect"],"ipa":"/pɛʁ.spɛk.tiv/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/d/da/Fr-perspective.ogg/Fr-perspective.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"perspectives"},"examples":[{"text":"Permettez-moi de vous mettre ceci en perspective.","en":"Let me put this in perspective for you.","words":[{"g":"to permit, to allow","l":"permettre"},{"g":"me"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"you"},{"g":"to put"},{"g":"this"},{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Elle a un emploi avec de bonnes perspectives.","en":"She has a job with good prospects.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"has","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"job"},{"g":"with"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"good","l":"bon"},null]},{"text":"Les perspectives sont sombres.","en":"The outlook is grim.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/1102844","words":[{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},null,{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"dark","l":"sombre"}]},{"text":"C'est une perspective déprimante.","en":"It's a depressing prospect.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"depressing","l":"déprimant"}]},{"text":"Il était coincé dans un boulot sans perspective.","en":"He was trapped in a dead-end job.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"to be","l":"être"},{"g":"stuck"},{"g":"in"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"work"},{"g":"without"},null]}]}